    "answer": {
      "short": "$12\\,222$.\n\nIts digit sum is 9.",
      "worked": "With at most four digits, the largest possible digit sum is $4\\times2=8$, so at least five digits are needed. For five digits to have sum 9, use four 2s and one 1: $1+2+2+2+2=9$. Put 1 first to obtain the smallest arrangement, 12 222.",
